[13 Regression] middle-end Missed vectorization: failed to vectorize simple reduction max since GCC-13
#include <algorithm>

int foo(int *a, int n) {
  int max = -987654321;
  for (int i = 0; i < n; ++i)
    max = std::max(max, a[i]);

  return max;
}

This is a simple loop reduction max.

Reference:https://godbolt.org/z/WMvfobK4bFrom the reference, we can know GCC-12 can vectorize it but failed to vectorize
it on both GCC-13 and GCC-14.
